              max_holders: 100,
              note: "An S corporation has at most 100 shareholders, each an individual, an estate, an eligible trust (a grantor trust, a qualified subchapter S trust or an electing small business trust) or a 501(c)(3) organization; never a corporation or a partnership (IRC section 1361(b), (c)(2), (c)(6))."
